  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "In the latest Open Beta there is currently an issue where the Blend Weight count in VRLow has been set to 2 bones, compared to the old settings with 4.\nWith this, most avatars in the game will partially break due to bones not being able to be used for their intended purpose, especially on models that use rigging techniques such as twist bones and facial rigs.",
